  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 305.02 Current Use Assessment Ranges for Farm Land. The assessment ranges for farm land shall be $90 to $523 per acre.\n\nSource. #12857-B, eff 8-23-19; ss by #13573, eff 4-1-23; ss by #13908, eff 4-1-24; ss by #14204, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14539, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
